{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48788","headline":"人日兼立春小园宴 · 苏頲","name":"人日兼立春小园宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄山积高次，表里望京邑。\n白日最灵朝，登攀尽原隰。\n年灰律象动，阳气开迎入。\n烟霭长薄含，临流小溪涩。\n宾朋莫我弃，词赋当春立。\n更与韶物期，不孤东园集。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48788.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48788","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}